# Messages for the binary's own errors. Each id is an error's code, which
# begins with the crate's name; the variables are its args.

ctxloom-unstamped = this binary carries no usable version stamp ("{ $stamp }"): it cannot say which build or commit is answering
ctxloom-unstamped-fix = build it through the task runner (`just build`), whose build script stamps it with versionator
